    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37713" root="لزب" body-key="l">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَزْبَةٌ</span></b>  <i>Adversity; difficulty; distress;</i> (S, K;)
<i>drought:</i> (S:) pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لِزَبٌ</span> (IJ, K: in the CK <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَزْبٌ</span>)
and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَزْبَاتٌ</span>: (S, K:) the latter with the <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ز</span> quiescent, because it is [originally] an epithet. (S.)
E. g. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَصَابَتْهُمْ لَزْبَةٌ</span> <i>Distress and drought befell
them.</i> (S.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَنَةٌ لَزْبَةٌ</span> A <i>severe year; a year
of drought.</i> (TA.)

